        "data": {
          "comment": "# Comfy Outpaint to Any Aspect Ratio - Nano Banana Pro\n\nUpload your image, input your desired aspect ratio and the images position (as a percentage) in the new aspect ratio composite. Uses Nano Banana Pro to generate an outpainted version of your image to fit the new dimensions. Runs on Comfy Cloud and needs Comfy Cloud partner credits.\n\n**How it works:** The Comfy nodes form the complete template graph. Run submits the graph to Comfy Cloud and saves its outputs.\n\n**Try this:** Change the prompt or the Load node inputs and run again to compare results.\n\nSource: https://github.com/Comfy-Org/workflow_templates/blob/1ae390968e323dba24a6991d1860ded051f5a79b/templates/template_outpaint_to_any_aspect_ratio_nano_banana_pro.json (MIT). Model licenses apply separately."
