        "type": "comfy.GeminiImage2Node",
        "data": {
          "prompt": "Outpaint/fill the green pixels. Retain composition of the visible images pixels. Analyze the original image content to understand what the outpainted region should be. \nDO NOT MODIFY the original images pixels. It must remain exactly as is. ONLY ALTER THE GREEN PIXELS.\nThe green outpainted pixels must seamlessly blend into the scene. DO NOT COPY/PASTE existing pixels into the target outpainted area.",
